  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LILOMA Project_ CCSL</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LILOMA is designed as a livelihoods and peace-building initiative designed to consolidate and strengthen economic recovery among women affected by conflict in Pujehun District. The project builds on CCSL&#x2019;s earlier LEAP intervention, which supported women through savings groups, small livelihood activities, and community peace-building processes.</narrative>
  </description>
